<main class="flex-1">
    <section class="mx-6 mt-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 md:p-8">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500">Design in Tailwind, keep it as code</p>
        <h1 class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-gray-900 md:text-4xl">Projects, a theme, and a catalog of finished parts.</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[15px] text-gray-600">Design pages on a canvas, write the code beside them, and keep everything in a project. Your theme restyles every part. Export to HTML, React, Vue or Svelte, and let coding agents read and write it over MCP.</p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
            <a href="{{#if user}}/projects{{else}}/auth/sign-up{{/if}}" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-md bg-black px-5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-neutral-800">{{#if user}}Open your projects{{else}}Get started{{/if}}</a>
            <a href="/catalog" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-50">Browse the catalog</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3 text-sm text-gray-700 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
            <li class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-3"><span class="font-medium text-gray-900">One home for work</span><br>A project holds its pages, components and theme.</li>
            <li class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-3"><span class="font-medium text-gray-900">A theme, not a rebuild</span><br>Brand colour, gray, font and corners restyle everything.</li>
            <li class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-3"><span class="font-medium text-gray-900">Export anywhere</span><br>HTML, React, Vue or Svelte, with the theme setup.</li>
            <li class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-3"><span class="font-medium text-gray-900">MCP for coding agents</span><br>Claude Code and Cursor read and write your projects.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="mx-6 mt-10 flex items-end justify-between">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Catalog</h2>
        <a href="/catalog" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900">See all &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div id="catalogGrid" class="grid gap-5 p-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {{#each families}}
        <a href="/catalog/{{slug}}" class="group block rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
            <div class="h-32 overflow-hidden rounded-t-xl border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
                <iframe data-sample="{{slug}}" title="{{name}}" class="pointer-events-none h-full w-full border-0" tabindex="-1" loading="lazy"></iframe>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">{{name}}</h3><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">{{styles}} styles</span></div>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">{{description}}</p>
            </div>
        </a>
        {{/each}}
    </div>
</main>
<script id="catalogData" type="application/json">{{{json families}}}</script>
<script type="module" src="/public/js/catalog.js"></script>
